    "$i": "about_desc",
    "$v": "Isibonisi seMIDI esilungiselelwe iifowuni ze-smart feature (Nokia 2720 Flip, 8000 4G, 6300 4G, 8110 4G, JioPhone...). Ijolisa kumbhobho wonikezelo lweCanvas ephuculweyo ukuze ubonise ngokutyibilikayo iingoma ezixineneyo eziMnyama ze-MIDI kwihardware enyanzelweyo."
